 bx('ca', '<b>Recent development (April 2025):</b> the Supreme Court resolved to place <b>judges\' asset declarations in the public domain</b>. It also expanded online disclosure of information concerning judicial appointments. These steps strengthen transparency without transferring control of judicial decisions to the executive. <i>(verify dates)</i>'),
